#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:32
#, no-c-format
msgid "Date &amp; Time"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:34
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"You can use this module to alter the system date and time, using a "
"convenient graphical interface."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:37
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"You must have system administrator (<systemitem class=\"username\">root</"
"systemitem>) access to change the system date and time. If you do not have "
"this access level, this module will only show you the current settings."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:42
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"When you first start, you are in display mode only. To modify your settings, "
"click on <guibutton>Administrator Mode</guibutton>. If you are logged in as "
"<systemitem class=\"username\">root</systemitem>, you will go straight to "
"the change dialog. If not, &kde; will ask for a superuser password."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:49
#, no-c-format
msgid "Modifying your settings"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:51
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"You set the date using the left half of the module. Simply choose your month "
"(the drop down box at the top), year (the spin box at the top), and the day "
"of the month (simply click on the day in the calendar)."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:56
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"You set the time using the spin boxes at the bottom of the clock. You can "
"also directly enter your value."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:59
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The time is represented in 24 hour format. If you want the system time to be "
"set to 8:00 PM, you need to set the hour spinbox to <guilabel>20</guilabel> "
"(8 + 12). If you want the system time set to 8:00 AM, you should set the "
"hour spinbox to <guilabel>8</guilabel>."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:65
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"To set a new time zone, simply select one from the drop down box at the "
"bottom."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:68
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"When you have set the correct date and time, simply click <guibutton>Apply</"
"guibutton> to make the changes permanent."
msgstr ""
